{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "autoEstCont 的机制是：利用在 soup 中高表达且为某群体标记基因的基因来估计背景污染，标记基因通过 tfidf 方法识别，随后在 cluster 层面计算污染比例。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "The idea of this method is that genes that are highly expressed in the soup and are marker genes for some population can be used to estimate the background contamination. Marker genes are identified using the tfidf method (see quickMarkers). The contamination fraction is then calculated at the cluster level for each of these genes and clusters are then aggressively pruned to remove those that give implausible estimates."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供 clusters=absent，因此当前状态缺少 autoEstCont 机制所依赖的 cluster 层面信息。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:clusters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供 count_matrix=droplet UMI counts，这符合 SoupX 面向 droplet-based scRNA-seq 的背景去除场景。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:count_matrix"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "现有证据只说明聚类信息对 subtraction 方法“高度推荐”，并未把聚类列为 autoEstCont 的必需输入或执行阻断条件。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 5,
          "quote": "As expression data is highly sparse at the single cell level, it is highly recommended that clustering information be provided to allow the subtraction method to share information between cells."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：autoEstCont 的科学假设是通道内包含多种具有不同标记基因的细胞类型；对高度同质的细胞可能得到警告、错误或极高污染估计，这属于可检测性局限，不代表当前数据一定不适用。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 6,
          "quote": "This function assumes that the channel contains multiple distinct cell types with different marker genes. If you try and run it on a channel with very homogenous cells (e.g. a cell line, flow-sorted cells), you will likely get a warning, an error, and/or an extremely high contamination estimate."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：背景表达谱通常由低 UMI 的空液滴估计，但现有来源没有给出可推广到任意数据的全局整数阈值或必需顺序，不能据此要求必须先过滤空液滴。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 7,
          "quote": "To estimate the background expression profile we consider all droplets with <Nemp UMIs, which we assume unambiguously do not contain cells."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": {
    "question": "你希望用哪种方式获得 autoEstCont 所需的 cluster 信息：提供已有的聚类标签，还是先对 droplet UMI counts 进行聚类？",
    "missing_field": "cluster_source",
    "why_needed": "autoEstCont 在 cluster 层面计算污染比例；没有聚类标签时，需要明确是补充外部聚类结果还是先执行聚类，这决定后续步骤。"
  }
}
